The main problem with teleporting liches is that they can heal by
teleporting back to the upstairs. Hence, my advice in fighting them (if
you decide to fight them at all) is to go down, and wait on the upstairs
until it attacks you. While you're standing on the stairs, it won't
teleport away once it's teleported next to you to attack, and you should
be able to kill it. Move away from the stairs even once, and it will
probably go there itself, and either heal or escape upstairs.

